    },
    {
      "entry": 18667,
      "name": "Blackheart the Inciter",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18667:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:6d44c31e81ab586f92cf91d0",
            "source:b4c494674ccafa5e8c2c648d",
            "source:18a5a0bb33bb2109cb5bdf69",
            "source:fd3857cc77d1b3224853b1fe",
            "source:c2333d8c064ef2dac70836c8",
            "source:0f16f8304689f4711b6703fd"
          ],
          "text": "Blackheart the Inciter imagines a new universe and calls for all flesh to burn and all creation to be unmade. He offers power to his listeners, presenting destruction as the road to a remade cosmos; when challenged, he turns to threats and gleeful violence.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18667
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18708,
      "name": "Murmur",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18708:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:842983482d1a7281c3694b7d",
            "source:85adabd6f756d19336664da1",
            "source:e5b7d892a31025fea1280682"
          ],
          "text": "Known as Murmur, this cosmic being was summoned by the Shadow Council and caused the explosion of Auchindoun. The Council lost control of it, and it threatens to break free from the Shadow Labyrinth into the outside world. Its presence draws energy from the air.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18708
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18731,
      "name": "Ambassador Hellmaw",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18731:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f2537e70f38845070bfd6d45",
            "source:21262d48a49db32fa2c931d4",
            "source:21eacc7492e217d500246ddc",
            "source:c8bb65cfdc93ff802400b4be",
            "source:9e88c064a2f05ad6c27169de",
            "source:ce34fed8570c1d8e3e439723",
            "source:2bb55df8fa502f774ec52c8f"
          ],
          "text": "Ambassador Hellmaw is a hostile presence in the Shadow Labyrinth who calls it a sanctuary. He treats intruders as infidels and “sniveling pests,” threatens them with agony, and regards a fight as relief from tedium. When pressed, he calls on nearby fools for aid.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18731
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18732,
      "name": "Grandmaster Vorpil",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18732:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:a5378e662adfa68c66ca0586",
            "source:0e2677c57d9540ba16116c19",
            "source:4efddb0e80a6ce5cbe807204",
            "source:27a75cb888b5a1314e459c52",
            "source:93b30022290ea163534b8bd7",
            "source:616bfed8e28085dffc847654"
          ],
          "text": "Grandmaster Vorpil is a powerful Shadow Council warlock in the Shadow Labyrinth, where he holds the Lexicon Demonica. He warns of a returning destroyer of worlds and the coming destruction of all things. He commands others as their master, calls for aid when threatened, and declares that he serves and would give his life gladly.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18732
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18794,
      "name": "Cabal Ritualist",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18794:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:e50c9e1338a7580c89058b39",
            "source:0acaace0d94ad50250a3ee2a",
            "source:a4004c6180476b7e4e67b006",
            "source:7229c49ed2442c30ed826b19",
            "source:38b4f5b6bbdd56950b06a7d5",
            "source:60ae9b174ce0e585e1920b45"
          ],
          "text": "A Cabal ritualist in the Shadow Labyrinth, this servant of the Cabal’s rites claims to do what necessity demands and expects a reward. The ritualist invokes Sargeras while channeling the Crystal Channel effect.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18794
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18796,
      "name": "Fel Overseer",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18796:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:2a7f07cea637149724eb04e2",
            "source:2ee3f36396669a1034e6fc25",
            "source:4632683ff0426230305542ce",
            "source:88519a70a8e75390577a0e70"
          ],
          "text": "A Legion-aligned Fel Overseer confronts intruders with boasts of the Legion's strength and threats to feast on their souls. Its combat speech casts it as a confident, openly hostile enforcer.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18796
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18797,
      "name": "Tortured Skeleton",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18797:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:85310977c7d196290e8d0ddf",
            "source:43a95893217cd6620a378f16",
            "source:13d3f2e412b9c356dae6877c"
          ],
          "text": "A Tortured Skeleton is an undead adversary that appears dead until provoked; on aggro, it rises from its dead stance. It is one of the Shadow Labyrinth's recurring hostile creatures.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18797
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18830,
      "name": "Cabal Fanatic",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18830:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:e44147dfc8edfc180568ddc5",
            "source:c8625f4a2e7c5e6bddeb9667",
            "source:1f5fcae67c5e448deb9a1546",
            "source:ddef47237c60cb60b7b6a4cc",
            "source:4cd209f8bccae1a0a8643ce8"
          ],
          "text": "A Cabal Fanatic is a Sargeras-devoted combatant who says they do what they must and expects a reward for it. Their aggro call invokes Sargeras, grounding their service in the Cabal's demonic cause.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18830
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18848,
      "name": "Malicious Instructor",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18848:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ab241c4b2edbd5073fcb4679",
            "source:6495d0e68e12fc7ab37f8116",
            "source:e20fa6fad532360e790a7d44",
            "source:18fca159598b7310fe5b1ac8",
            "source:e2f0ae68af4e10453423554c"
          ],
          "text": "A Malicious Instructor is a six-armed demoness serving the Legion in the Shadow Labyrinth. She threatens to feast on opponents' souls and boasts that none can stand against the Legion, presenting a cruel, confident combatant.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18848
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18891,
      "name": "Spy To'gun",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18891:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ec758df678f382fbc719b84d",
            "source:2e470ddec7cf444995fe0c1a",
            "source:436a07e067dcb562ef897945"
          ],
          "text": "Spy To'gun is a Shattrath spy found caged in the Shadow Labyrinth. When Grik'tha sends help, he reacts with amused uncertainty about whether she was touched or foolish, then asks for help escaping.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18891
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    }
  ],
  "place": "Shadow Labyrinth",
  "place_records": [
    {
      "authored": false,
      "id": "zone:3789",
      "layer": "zone",
      "priority": 40,
      "sources": [
        "dbc:area:3789",
        "dbc:area:3688",
        "dbc:area:3519",
        "world:creature:18732",
        "world:creature:18708",
        "world:creature:18631",
        "world:creature:18891",
        "world:quest:10091"
      ],
      "text": "You are in the Shadow Labyrinth, inside Auchindoun in Terokkar Forest. Shadow Council warlocks hold it, Grandmaster Vorpil among them, and its cultists use special devices to make soul shards and to summon demonic forces they cannot control. Murmur, a cosmic being the Council summoned, caused Auchindoun to explode and threatens to break free into the outside world. A Shattrath spy, Spy To'gun, is caged here.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 3789
      }
    }
  ],
